  "text": "Low Effort Rasial, The First Necromancer\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nPositioning\n\n​\nNecromancy Low Effort Method (20+ kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nItems\n⬥ At least 4 pieces of the First Necromancer's equipment \n⬥ Zemouregal's Nexus \n    • Deathwarden Nexus may not be as consistent\n    • Do NOT use The Devourer's Nexus. Using this will result in failure.\nPerks\n⬥ Robe Top of the First Necromancer \n    • Ultimatums 4  + Crackling 4  \n    • Equilibrium 4 \n⬥ Masterwork Legs  / \n    • Absorbative 4 \n    • Lucky 6  + Undead Slayer \nAbilities\n⬥ Conjure Undead Army \n    • Have all 4 conjures selected\n⬥ Greater Bone Shield \nOther\n⬥ Vampyrism aspect \n    • Can be multi-cast to last 60 minutes\n⬥ Pray  and \n    •  may not be as consistent\n⬥ Hellhound \n⬥ Bonfire Boost  and Ogre flask (thermal) \n    • Wear HP boosting equipment\n    • Totem of Vitality  preferred over Bonfire \n⬥ Teleporting to War's Retreat after every kill to replenish prayer, adrenaline, familiar and player health, and reset cooldowns.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Necromancy preset \n​\n\nAction Bar\n\n​\nThe fight\n⬥ Rejoin instance →  or  to the starting position →  →  → use  at the start of the fight.\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• In rare cases, you may die\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Necromancy Low Effort\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Low Effort Rasial, The First Necromancer ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Positioning ​ Necromancy Low Effort Method (20+ kph) Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Items ⬥ At least 4 pieces of the First Necromancer's equipment ⬥ Zemouregal's Nexus • Deathwarden Nexus may not be as consistent • Do NOT use The Devourer's Nexus. Using this will result in failure. Perks ⬥ Robe Top of the First Necromancer • Ultimatums 4 + Crackling 4 • Equilibrium 4 ⬥ Masterwork Legs / • Absorbative 4 • Lucky 6 + Undead Slayer Abilities ⬥ Conjure Undead Army • Have all 4 conjures selected ⬥ Greater Bone Shield Other ⬥ Vampyrism aspect • Can be multi-cast to last 60 minutes ⬥ Pray and • may not be as consistent ⬥ Hellhound ⬥ Bonfire Boost and Ogre flask (thermal) • Wear HP boosting equipment • Totem of Vitality preferred over Bonfire ⬥ Teleporting to War's Retreat after every kill to replenish prayer, adrenaline, familiar and player health, and reset cooldowns. ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Necromancy preset ​ Action Bar ​ The fight ⬥ Rejoin instance → or to the starting position → → → use at the start of the fight. ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• In rare cases, you may die ​ Example Kills ⬥ Necromancy Low Effort ​",
