    {
      "index": 22,
      "tag": "div",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "flex-vertical whitney theme-dark"
      },
      "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nItems\n⬥ At least 4 pieces of the First Necromancer's equipment \n⬥ Zemouregal's Nexus \n    • Deathwarden Nexus may not be as consistent\n    • Do NOT use The Devourer's Nexus. Using this will result in failure.\nPerks\n⬥ Robe Top of the First Necromancer \n    • Ultimatums 4  + Crackling 4  \n    • Equilibrium 4 \n⬥ Masterwork Legs  / \n    • Absorbative 4 \n    • Lucky 6  + Undead Slayer \nAbilities\n⬥ Conjure Undead Army \n    • Have all 4 conjures selected\n⬥ Greater Bone Shield \nOther\n⬥ Vampyrism aspect \n    • Can be multi-cast to last 60 minutes\n⬥ Pray  and \n    •  may not be as consistent\n⬥ Hellhound \n⬥ Bonfire Boost  and Ogre flask (thermal) \n    • Wear HP boosting equipment\n    • Totem of Vitality  preferred over Bonfire \n⬥ Teleporting to War's Retreat after every kill to replenish prayer, adrenaline, familiar and player health, and reset cooldowns.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 166445,
        "end": 173240
      }
    },
